1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:06,839
Meera is seventy-four and takes five medicines,
including warfarin, a blood thinner.

2
00:00:06,889 --> 00:00:09,210
Her knee hurts. Can she take Advil?

3
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:13,670
One in six older Americans is at
risk of a major drug interaction.

4
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:19,261
An AI could answer in seconds, but it would
hear her voice, her name and her health.

5
00:00:19,311 --> 00:00:22,880
PillCheck is built so the cloud
only ever sees drug names.

6
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,940
Meera: Can I take Advil?

7
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:29,898
PillCheck: Please don't take Advil with your
Coumadin because combining them can cause serious

8
00:00:29,948 --> 00:00:30,371
bleeding.

9
00:00:30,421 --> 00:00:34,466
Please check with your doctor or pharmacist
first before adding this medicine.

10
00:00:35,316 --> 00:00:40,276
It said Coumadin: the name on her own list,
which lives only in this browser.

11
00:00:40,676 --> 00:00:45,594
Each step is pinned to one place.
Speech recognition runs on this computer.

12
00:00:45,644 --> 00:00:49,700
Gemini Nano, through Firebase AI
Logic in ONLY ON DEVICE mode,

13
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:51,356
pulls out the drug names.

14
00:00:51,756 --> 00:00:55,138
A leak guard lets only known
ingredient names through.

15
00:00:55,188 --> 00:01:00,160
Then cloud Gemini, in ONLY IN CLOUD mode,
checks the interaction against F.D.A.

16
00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:02,956
labels, and a local
voice speaks the answer.

17
00:01:03,356 --> 00:01:05,845
The strip shows where every step ran.

18
00:01:05,895 --> 00:01:09,276
Everything that left the
device: three drug names.

19
00:01:09,676 --> 00:01:12,566
Now I'll simulate a model
leaking a name and birthday.

20
00:01:12,966 --> 00:01:17,304
PillCheck: I stopped before checking,
because something personal was about to be sent.

21
00:01:17,354 --> 00:01:18,766
Nothing left this device.

22
00:01:19,616 --> 00:01:22,593
I found that without
Chrome's on-device model,

23
00:01:22,643 --> 00:01:26,146
the SDK quietly sends ON
DEVICE requests to the cloud.

24
00:01:26,196 --> 00:01:30,226
So PillCheck checks every on-device
step, and refuses instead.

25
00:01:30,626 --> 00:01:34,822
PillCheck: I can't check safely on this device.
I won't send your question anywhere.

26
00:01:34,872 --> 00:01:38,486
If you're unsure about a medicine,
please call your pharmacist.

27
00:01:39,336 --> 00:01:44,476
Every check is logged in Firestore with no
personal data, and App Check is enforced.

28
00:01:44,526 --> 00:01:48,986
Her family can read it back:
only medicine names ever left this computer.

29
00:01:49,386 --> 00:01:53,886
On thirty test pairs:
no missed dangers, no false alarms.

30
00:01:54,286 --> 00:01:58,786
PillCheck. One button, a calm answer,
and her voice stays home.
